      "title": "Hyperscalers List GPUs at Nearly 2× the GPU-Cloud Price, Fluence Research Finds",
      "link": "https://www.newsbtc.com/news/hyperscalers-list-gpus-at-nearly-2x-the-gpu-cloud-price-fluence-research-finds/",
      "summary": "The AI Compute Race report prices GPU compute outside the biggest buyers: a three-year commitment cuts the median price by 48%, while 17 of 22 tracked GPU models rose in price over the past year DALLAS, Texas – November 13, 2026 – Fluence has published The AI Compute Race, a report that prices GPU cloud compute for every company that is not a frontier lab or a hyperscaler. It was produced with research partners NEAR AI, io.net, Boundless, Phala, Gensyn, Fortytwo, Theta, Compute Labs and GAIB. Its central finding: where a company buys a GPU-hour sets the price. Across H100, H200 and B200 models",
